    {
      "source": "Bind the specified target <a href=\"Bindable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind\"><code>Bindable</code></a> using this binder's\n<a href=\"../source/ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>property sources</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用此绑定器的<code>property sources</code><a href=\"../source/ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\">属性源</a>来绑定指定的目标<a href=\"Bindable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind\"><code>Bindable</code></a>。",
      "count": 9
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>sources</code> - the sources used for binding",
      "translation": "<code>sources</code> - 用于绑定的源",
      "count": 9
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>target</code> - the target bindable",
      "translation": "<code>target</code> - 目标绑定项",
      "count": 8
    },
    {
      "source": "Bind the specified target <a href=\"Bindable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind\"><code>Bindable</code></a> using this binder's\n<a href=\"../source/ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>property sources</code></a> or create a new instance using\nthe type of the <a href=\"Bindable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind\"><code>Bindable</code></a> if the result of the binding is <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "使用此绑定器的<a href=\"../source/ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>property sources</code></a>绑定指定的目标 <a href=\"Bindable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind\"><code>Bindable</code></a>，或者如果绑定结果为<code>null</code>，则使用<a href=\"Bindable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind\"><code>Bindable</code></a>的类型创建新实例。",
      "count": 7
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>placeholdersResolver</code> - strategy to resolve any property placeholders",
      "translation": "<code>placeholdersResolver</code> - 用于解析任何属性占位符的策略",
      "count": 7
    },
    {
      "source": "the binding result (never <code>null</code>)",
      "translation": "绑定结果（永远不会为<code>null</code>）",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"Binder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind\"><code>Binder</code></a> instance from the specified environment.",
      "translation": "从指定的环境创建一个新的<a href=\"Binder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind\"><code>Binder</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>conversionService</code> - the conversion service to convert values (or <code>null</code>\nto use <a href=\"../../../convert/ApplicationConversionService.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.convert\"><code>ApplicationConversionService</code></a>)",
      "translation": "<code>conversionService</code> - 用于转换值的转换器（或为使用<a href=\"../../../convert/ApplicationConversionService.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.convert\"><code>ApplicationConversionService</code></a>而将值转换为 <code>null</code>）",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>propertyEditorInitializer</code> - initializer used to configure the property editors\nthat can convert values (or <code>null</code> if no initialization is required). Often\nused to call <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ConfigurableBeanFactory.html#copyRegisteredEditorsTo(org.springframework.beans.PropertyEditorRegistry)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableBeanFactory.copyRegisteredEditorsTo(PropertyEditorRegistry)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>propertyEditorInitializer</code> - 用于配置可转换值的属性编辑器的初始化器（如果不需要初始化，则为 <code>null</code>）。通常用于调用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ConfigurableBeanFactory.html#copyRegisteredEditorsTo(org.springframework.beans.PropertyEditorRegistry)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableBeanFactory.copyRegisteredEditorsTo(PropertyEditorRegistry)</code></a>。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>defaultBindHandler</code> - the default bind handler to use if none is specified when\nbinding",
      "translation": "<code>defaultBindHandler</code> - 如果在绑定时未指定，则使用的默认绑定处理器。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "the bound or created object",
      "translation": "已绑定或创建的对象",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>handler</code> - the bind handler (may be <code>null</code>)",
      "translation": "<code>handler</code> - 绑定处理器（可为 <code>null</code>）",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Bind the specified target <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> using this binder's\n<a href=\"../source/ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>property sources</code></a> or create a new instance of\nthe specified target <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> if the result of the binding is <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "使用此绑定器的<a href=\"../source/ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>property sources</code></a>绑定指定的目标<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>，或者如果绑定结果为<code>null</code>，则创建指定目标<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>的新实例。",
      "count": 3
